            "review_title": "Review at Chica Bar",
            "review_text": "Peter G\nThailand6 contributions\n2\nBuy 5 tequila in tequila bar Overcharged 100%\nOct 2018 • Friends\nI was invited there by a friend of the owner. arrived there, and was given a drink from vodka bottle on the table, thank you, very nice. was asked if i can buy my date a tequila, sure no problem, and her friend? sure no problem, and other friends? sure no problem. I dont drink tequila but i bought 5 for the beautiful girls. \n\nwhen i ordered it was not to the bar it was to a girl. She whispered to a friend so i could not hear. That girl whispered to another girl and that girl ran to the bar to tell bar staff... I said hey with a big smile whats going on.. but no reply, i was soon to find out when i asked for the bill. I got charged 100% more. 1 Million dong for 5 shots. \n\nIts not the money its the principle. why would you purposely charge 100% more? Wish i could spend 3 times that there have a fun night but i cant now, am i a welcomed friend or enemy. not either. Not a friend and not a enemy just a person they can take 100% advantage from probably like anyone else who walks in. \n\nAnd i got told by my date the owner really loves her boyfriend \" because he is rich\" lol \n\nWelcome to Vietnam !\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 30, 2018",
